  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAB lab development for Georgian Information Technology Agency (GITA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to make the Georgian IT sector less dependable on importing expertise and more internationally competitive.The project aims to contribute to the modernisation of the knowledge infrastructure in Georgia to stimulate innovation and entrepreneurship, focussing on new media and rapid prototyping services.Training of 20 new iLab and FabLab managers during the autumn and winter semester in 2015. Trained managers can help entrepreneurs develop and commercialise their business opportunities. Students can also learn and study in these labs.</narrative>
  </description>
